WEBVTT

00:00.760 --> 00:04.560
Tunaulizwa, ni kipi kigawo tasa cha 36?

00:04.560 --> 00:07.190
Ngoja niondoe hii karatasi

00:07.190 --> 00:11.230
Kwahiyo kigawo tasa cha 36.

00:11.230 --> 00:14.060
Tuanze na kigawo tasa kidogo tunachokijua,

00:14.060 --> 00:15.130
nayo ni 2.

00:15.130 --> 00:17.730
Tufikirie kuhusu hii, je, 2 inaingia kwenye 36?

00:17.730 --> 00:18.770
Ndio, inaingia.

00:18.770 --> 00:21.447
36 ni 2 mara 18.

00:21.447 --> 00:22.530
Tunaweza kuiandika hii hapa.

00:22.530 --> 00:27.150
36 ni 2 mara 18.

00:27.150 --> 00:30.270
Kwahiyo tunayo 36 ambayo ni zao la namba tasa,

00:30.270 --> 00:32.890
na 18 ni zao la namba mbili.

00:32.890 --> 00:35.640
Ina vigawo vingine zaidi mbali ya 1 na 18.

00:35.640 --> 00:37.610
Tujaribu kuigawa hii namba

00:37.610 --> 00:39.720
Je, inagawanyika kwa 2?

00:39.720 --> 00:40.510
Ndiyo.

00:40.510 --> 00:42.370
18 ni 2 mara 9.

00:46.120 --> 00:49.570
Na 9 nayo ni zao la namba mbili ambayo bado hatujaigawa.

00:49.570 --> 00:51.790
Ni dhahiri kua hizi 2 zote ni tasa

00:51.790 --> 00:55.710
9 haigawanyiki kwa 2, lakini inagawanyika kwa 3

00:55.710 --> 00:59.800
9 ni 3 mara 3.

00:59.800 --> 01:08.450
Tunaweza kusema kwamba 36 ni sawasawa na 2 mara 2 mara 3 mara 3

01:08.450 --> 01:10.460
Hivi ndivyo vigawe vyake tasa.

01:10.460 --> 01:12.710
Namba zote hizi ni tasa.

01:12.710 --> 01:17.790
Sasa tuirudishe ile karatasi tuone tunapata jibu sahihi.

01:17.790 --> 01:22.050
2 mara 2 mara 3 mara 3.

01:22.050 --> 01:23.410
Unaweza kuhakiki mwenyewe.

01:23.410 --> 01:26.740
Kama una zao la namba ambazo ni zote ni tasa

01:26.740 --> 01:29.800
na zao lake likiwa ni 36, hapo utakua umefanikiwa

01:29.800 --> 01:32.350
kuigawa namba hiyo kwenye vigawo tasa

01:32.350 --> 01:35.080
Tufanye mifano zaidi kama hii.

01:35.080 --> 01:37.170
Ni kipi kigawo cha 30?

01:37.170 --> 01:39.300
Nitaiondoa tena hii karatasi.

01:39.300 --> 01:41.230
Kwahiyo tufanya kwa kutumia njia ile ile.

01:41.230 --> 01:44.820
Kwahiyo, 30-- inagawika kwa 2.

01:44.820 --> 01:48.911
Tunaweza kuiandika kama 2 mara 15.

01:48.911 --> 01:50.950
15 haigawiki kwa 2.

01:50.950 --> 01:52.970
Lakini inagawika kwa 3.

01:52.970 --> 01:56.160
Ni sawa na kusema 3 mara 5.

01:56.160 --> 01:58.560
Na zote 3 na 5 ni namba tasa.

01:58.560 --> 02:01.810
Zinagawika kwa 1 na kwa zenyewe tu.

02:01.810 --> 02:07.850
Kwahiyo vigawo tasa vya 30 ni 2 mara 3 mara 5.

02:07.850 --> 02:09.419
Tuirudishe ile karatasi ya mwanzoni.

02:09.419 --> 02:15.960
Kwahiyo ni 2 mara 3 mara 5.

02:15.960 --> 02:19.230
Tufanye moja zaidi kama hii.

02:19.230 --> 02:22.490
Ni vipi vigawo tasa vya 73?

02:22.490 --> 02:23.925
Hii 73 ina changamoto kidogo,

02:26.510 --> 02:28.370
Nitaiondoa hii karatasi.

02:28.370 --> 02:31.050
Tunaweza kujaribu kuandika vigawo vya 73.

02:31.050 --> 02:32.150
Kwahiyo unaweza kujaribu kwa 2.

02:32.150 --> 02:33.650
Ni dhahiri kwamba hii ni namba witiri

02:33.650 --> 02:35.380
Kwahiyo 2 haitagawanyika kwenye 73.

02:35.380 --> 02:37.120
Unaweza kujaribu kwa 3.

02:37.120 --> 02:39.550
Utaona kuwa 3 inagawanyika kwenye 72.

02:39.550 --> 02:42.515
Kama unaigawanya kwa 73, unabakiwa na 1.

02:42.515 --> 02:45.070
Sawa, 4 sio namba tasa, kwahiyo hatuwezi kutumia

02:45.070 --> 02:46.790
5 haigawanyiki kwenye 73

02:46.790 --> 02:49.050
Haiishii na 5 au 0.

02:49.050 --> 02:52.310
7 haigawiki kwenye 73.

02:52.310 --> 02:55.522
7 inaingia kwenye 73, na utabakiwa na 3

02:55.522 --> 02:57.890
11 haigawiki kwenye 73.

02:57.890 --> 03:02.480
Inagawika kwenye 66 au 77, na sio 73.

03:02.480 --> 03:04.420
Ninajaribu namba nyingine zaidi

03:04.420 --> 03:07.080
inaonekana sio rahisi kupata namba

03:07.080 --> 03:10.020
ambayo inagawika kwenye 73

03:10.020 --> 03:15.330
Kwahiyo, nimeridhia kuichukua 73 yenyewe kama kigawo tasa.

03:15.330 --> 03:18.010
Kwahiyo hii ndio kigawe tasa chake

03:18.010 --> 03:19.350
Ni 73.

03:19.350 --> 03:21.390
Tuiandike hapa chini.

03:21.390 --> 03:24.190
Kwahiyo jibu hapa, tuandike 73.

03:24.190 --> 03:25.910
Na hunahaja ya kuandika 1 mara 73,

03:25.910 --> 03:28.540
kwasababu 1 sio namba tasa.

03:28.540 --> 03:34.070
Kumbuka, 1 ina kigawo kimoja tu, yenyewe

03:34.070 --> 03:37.380
Namba tasa ina vigawo viwili, 1 na yenyewe.

03:37.380 --> 03:39.690
Vigawo tasa viwili tofauti--1 na yenyewe.

03:39.690 --> 03:41.200
Na yenyewe sio moja.

03:41.200 --> 03:43.250
Kwahiyo hapa tunahitaji kuandika namba tasa.

03:43.250 --> 03:44.660
73 ni namba tasa.

03:44.660 --> 03:46.240
Tuhakiki jibu letu.

03:46.240 --> 03:47.867
Jibu letu ni sahihi.
